<% content_for :title, "Quest Club | Choose your adventure" %>
<main class="quest-home">
  <header class="quest-home-heading">
    <span class="eyebrow">SMALL STEPS. BIG DISCOVERIES.</span>
    <h1>Where will your <span>curiosity take you?</span></h1>
    <p>Pick a quest, try something new, and watch your confidence grow.</p>
  </header>
  <section class="quest-cards" aria-label="Choose an educational game">
    <a class="quest-card word-quest-card" href="<%= word_quest_path %>">
      <span class="quest-art" aria-hidden="true">📖</span>
      <span class="eyebrow">LET YOUR WORD POWER BLOOM</span>
      <h2>Word Quest</h2>
      <p>Discover missing letters, explore new words, and untangle word jumbles.</p>
      <span class="quest-detail">Six levels · Picture clues · Spelling adventures</span>
      <span class="quest-link">Play Word Quest <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
    </a>
    <a class="quest-card math-quest-card" href="<%= math_quest_path %>">
      <span class="quest-art" aria-hidden="true">🧮</span>
      <span class="eyebrow">LITTLE NUMBERS. BIG POSSIBILITIES.</span>
      <h2>Math Quest</h2>
      <p>Add, subtract, multiply, and solve your way to exciting new challenges.</p>
      <span class="quest-detail">Six levels · Helpful hints · Number adventures</span>
      <span class="quest-link">Play Math Quest <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
    </a>
    <a class="quest-card read-aloud-quest-card" href="<%= read_aloud_path %>">
      <span class="quest-art" aria-hidden="true">🔊</span>
      <span class="eyebrow">SOUND IT OUT. THEN SAY IT.</span>
      <h2>Read Aloud</h2>
      <p>Hear a word, sound it out, and practice saying it with confidence.</p>
      <span class="quest-detail">Eight stages · Phonics & word building · Speaking practice</span>
      <span class="quest-link">Try Read Aloud <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
    </a>
    <a class="quest-card trivia-quest-card" href="<%= trivia_path %>">
      <span class="quest-art" aria-hidden="true">🧠</span>
      <span class="eyebrow">LITTLE QUESTIONS. BIG DISCOVERIES.</span>
      <h2>Trivia</h2>
      <p>Explore animals, science, places, words, and more with curious questions.</p>
      <span class="quest-detail">Grades 1–5 · Multiple choice · Ten-question rounds</span>
      <span class="quest-link">Play Trivia <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
    </a>
    <a class="quest-card spot-quest-card" href="<%= spot_difference_path %>">
      <span class="quest-art" aria-hidden="true">🔍</span>
      <span class="eyebrow">LOOK A LITTLE CLOSER</span>
      <h2>Spot the Difference</h2>
      <p>Compare two pictures, find what changed, and mark your discoveries.</p>
      <span class="quest-detail">Ten picture puzzles · Two levels · 5 or 10 differences</span>
      <span class="quest-link">Play Spot the Difference <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
    </a>
    <a class="quest-card code-quest-card" href="<%= code_breaker_path %>">
      <span class="quest-art" aria-hidden="true">🔐</span>
      <span class="eyebrow">CRACK A LITTLE MYSTERY</span>
      <h2>Code Breakers</h2>
      <p>Decode secret messages or become a Code Detective and discover a hidden symbol code.</p>
      <span class="quest-detail">Four code types · Three levels · Ten codes per round</span>
      <span class="quest-link">Play Code Breakers <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
    </a>
  </section>
  <p class="quest-home-note">No timers. No pressure. Just a little practice and a whole lot of discovery.</p>
</main>
